{
 "_doc": "Plates for the handbook (the book repository's handbook/ppl/figures/): pictures from the 3D twin with numbered callouts and no words, in the format that book uses. The book's two editions share one file; each edition explains the numbers in a list under the figure (the legend below is what the English edition says today). render: the recipe for blender/render_plate.py (build frame of the model, metres). overlays: drawn over the render by build_plates.py, in canvas units (the canvas is `canvas` units wide; one unit is 1/640 of the width of the book's figures). A figure keeps the file name and the callout numbers of the one it replaces, so the book's text does not change.",
